{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>For demo version, only first 3 day is playable. Takes 20 to 25 minutes to complete. In full game 7 days will be playable</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Site: Night Shift</strong>\u00a0is a\u00a0<strong>first-person psychological horror game</strong>\u00a0set in a construction site. You play as a newly hired night guard, tasked with patrolling the grounds, checking for intruders, and making sure the site stays secure until morning. It\u2019s supposed to be an easy job \u2014 but when the sun goes down, the site reveals a side you were never warned about. The silence is never complete, the shadows never still\u2026 and you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911280/extras/85641a31a636f663090c2bc3abb833be.poster.avif?t=1759404262\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911280/extras/85641a31a636f663090c2bc3abb833be.webm?t=1759404262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were just looking for work. The position was straightforward: night guard at a construction site. No special skills required. Just walk the perimeter, keep an eye on the equipment, and wait for sunrise.But the night has a way of changing things. And this site\u2026 isn\u2019t what it seems.Armed with nothing more than a flashlight and a gun, you\u2019ll patrol half-finished buildings, shadow-filled corridors, and silent machinery. The hum of the city is gone. All you hear is the wind\u2026 and something else. Footsteps? Voices? You\u2019re supposed to be alone here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911280/extras/208dcd2c76824bae8d4e30ac2f2e68f8.poster.avif?t=1759404262\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911280/extras/208dcd2c76824bae8d4e30ac2f2e68f8.webm?t=1759404262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultra-realistic graphics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person horror experience</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon gameplay</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paranormal events</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense exploration</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is only the demo version \u2013 the full game will include many more features, events, and terrifying encounters</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911280/extras/ad35089ecd8b1e2b0e0ebe56860c8c1e.poster.avif?t=1759404262\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911280/extras/ad35089ecd8b1e2b0e0ebe56860c8c1e.webm?t=1759404262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911280/extras/ad35089ecd8b1e2b0e0ebe56860c8c1e.mp4?t=1759404262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3911280?t=1759404262","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/